Falsifies `capability::delete_touches_only_its_slot`.

The defect: `delete` clears the whole table rather than one slot, which is
`delete_matching` with a predicate that says yes to everything. The two live next
to each other in this file and one is a revocation sweep over every slot, so
reaching for the wrong body is the plausible mistake rather than an invented one.
The authority cost is a server holding one-shot Reply capabilities for two callers:
answering caller A silently orphans caller B, who waits for a reply nothing can
send.

Expected to fail: the harness's only assertion, `assert_eq!(cs.get(other),
before)`, on any table with an occupied slot other than the victim.

